### Localhost - Get all playlists
GET http://localhost:3000/api/playlists

### Localhost - Get playlist by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Localhost - Create playlist
POST http://localhost:3000/api/playlists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My New Playlist",
  "description": "Testing the API",
  "creator": "Jesus Tortolero",
  "genre": "jazz",
  "songs": ["Take Five", "So What"],
  "isPublic": true,
  "coverImage": "https://picsum.photos/400/400?random=10"
}

### Localhost - Update playlist
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Playlist Name"
}

### Localhost - Delete playlist
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_ID

